  objectiveText: Return to the Ship
  introText: "The station is tearing itself apart. The new engine comes in two halves
    \u2014 each of you carries one in your hands, all the way back to your ship:
    across collapsing bridges, falling cables and a gravity ring.\n\nBoth halves
    must be installed to fly home."
  completeTitle: ENGINE ONLINE
  completeText: 'The new engine roars to life. With the station collapsing behind
    you, the ship breaks free and turns for home.


    Thanks for playing BORROWED
    GRAVITY!'
  isFinalStage: 1
  holdToResetSeconds: 1
  playAmbience: 1
  autoContinueAfter: 4
  autoStartAfter: 8
